  "title": "Hope Bancorp Reports Financial Results for the Fourth Quarter and Full Year Ended December 31, 2025",
  "summary": "For the fourth quarter of 2025, net income of $34.5 million, up 12% quarter-over-quarter and up 42% year-over-year Hope Bancorp, Inc. (the “Company”) (NASDAQ: HOPE), the holding company of Bank of Hope (the “Bank”), today reported unaudited financial results for its fourth quarter and full year ended December 31, 2025. For the three months ended December 31, 2025, the Company recorded net income of $34.5 million, or $0.27 per diluted common share, up 12% from net income of $30.8 million, or $0.2",
